  "covered_behaviors": [
    "Raw numeric NaN, Infinity, -Infinity, 1e400 and -1e400 are injected into usage events and nested decoded final responses. Exponent tokens reach the real JSON decoder unchanged.",
    "The existing strict serializer rejects the decoded non-finite content before it is retained for receipt hashing. Usage-event rejection reports invalid_event; nested final-response rejection reports invalid_final_response.",
    "Every injected malformed transport result produces a persisted failed attempt and failed trial. Raw event bytes and their SHA-256 commitments are retained; monetary cost remains unknown.",
    "Rejected usage is omitted from parsed usage. A rejected final response retains independently valid usage and omits the decoded response.",
    "The broker makes one provider call despite a three-round limit, admits no usage or proposer actions, and seals through its harness abstention path.",
    "The adjacent usage regression retains complete exact-integer and explicit-zero controls and accepts quoted reason text containing NaN, Infinity, -Infinity and 1e400 as ordinary strings."
  ],
